        "Description": "Good day, agent.\r\rToday we are in Berlin. We will be impersonating the delivery guy who works for the Chicago-style pizza chain found across Germany. We will steal his clothes in order to kill him as well as four other targets.\r\rNo particular reason for killing these people, just do it? Best of luck, I will leave you to prepare.",
